      "notes": "Custom quant 'Q4KS-XL': Q4_K_S base + token_embd upgraded to Q5_K, quantized from bf16 (no requant) with custom importance matrix calibrated on ~600K mixed tokens (Wikipedia wikitext-103 prose + local C++/TS/Python code), 40L GQA dense granite arch, untied embeddings. Measured vs official Q4_K_M same GPU/build: KLD vs bf16 0.1333 vs 0.1796 (-26%), same-top-p 88.1% vs 86.0%, tg128 57.06 vs 54.24 (+5.2%), pp512 1748 vs 1724, file 4.79 GiB vs 5.10 GiB. Strictly better than stock Q4_K_M on all axes. r=3 medians.",
